WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:04.110
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:07.140
When you watch Kaleido Star,
keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.580
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.250
Well, well, well.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.050
We've not seen each other
for a long time. It's Layla.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.480
Did you see the legendary great maneuver
that I did with Sora?

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.920
I bet everything on that show.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.790
Both my own fate and my bond
with my best partner.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.260
I can no longer appear on Kaleido Stage,
but I have no regrets.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.670
Because I found a new dream.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.430
Sora, follow me.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:48.080
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:48.080
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the beginning is
red and black passions</i>

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:55.390
<i>Toki ni urahara na kokoro o tayori ni</i>

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:55.390
<i>Sometimes, we rely on our contrary hearts</i>

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:56.490
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:56.490
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:02.160
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:02.160
New Wings

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:02.160
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:10.100
<i>Koi ni aimai na kotae wa iranai</i>

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:10.100
<i>There is no place for ambiguous answers in love</i>

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:17.580
<i>Arienai genjitsu minai furi shite mo Bet</i>

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:17.580
<i>Even while pretending not to see the
impossible reality, we bet</i>

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:23.850
<i>Egatai shinjitsu Can U feel me now?</i>

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:23.850
<i>Hard to obtain truth. Can you feel me now?</i>

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:28.390
<i>Nesshiyasui jibun ni Say What?</i>

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:28.390
<i>Say what to myself who gets excited easily?</i>

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:31.760
<i>Tomadou iibun</i>

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:31.760
<i>I'm confused, what to say</i>

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:40.970
<i>Dreamin' samenai yume ochiteku sadame</i>

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:40.970
<i>Dreamin' the never-waking dream,
the falling fate</i>

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:46.740
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' U
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:46.740
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' you
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:56.080
<i>Believe in U hikikae ni subete ushinatte mo</i>

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:56.080
<i>I believe in you even if I lose everything for it</i>

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:01.610
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' U
No no no</i>

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:01.610
<i>Still lovin' Can't stop lovin' you
No no no</i>

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.230
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.230
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.140
Wow, we've got a vacation!

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.000
A whole week too!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.840
It's all thanks to regular maintenance.

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:22.340
I'm gonna take this chance to really
make the rounds of the comedy theatres!

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:26.250
I'll plan new productions like crazy at the library.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:30.020
I'm going to spend day and night
on special trapeze training.

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:31.650
Sora, would you mind joining me...

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:35.150
Everyone's so motivated.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:40.750
You will be Mina Murray.

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:45.360
Yes.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:55.280
If I stay like this, I can never
be a real Kaleido Star.

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:56.340
Is something wrong?

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.470
What? Oh...

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.270
It's nothing. It's nothing. It's nothing.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:05.250
Sora, when you've changed your clothes,
go to the Boss's office right away.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.190
He has a surprise for you.

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:08.520
What?

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:11.860
Somehow... I have a bad feeling about this.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:13.700
I think it's a conditioned reflex.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:17.070
I remember there was that time
you had to work during your time off.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:20.970
Just in case, you should go there
expecting the worst case scenario.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.070
The shock will be less that way.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.640
Go for it, Sora!

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.770
Okay.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.810
What?

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:32.440
I'm going to make a guest appearance
on stage with Miss Layla?!

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.510
It seems Layla's recommended you.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.520
But if you don't like it, do you want
to me to decline the offer?

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:42.020
Of course, I'm going!

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.960
I'll go to the North Pole,
the South Pole, anywhere!

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.220
Sora's going to appear on stage
with Miss Layla?

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.730
I'm going to see Miss Layla.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.720
Miss Layla...

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:55.800
"The Ever Amazing Miss Layla"

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.870
The Ever Amazing Miss Layla

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.870
"The Ever Amazing Miss Layla"

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:01.740
The Ever Amazing Miss Layla

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:24.960
Well... Please take me to Off Broadway.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:30.800
Follow that car.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.530
Miss Layla...

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:56.920
Sora!

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.550
It's been a long time, hasn't it, Sora?

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:27.060
Miss Layla!

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.090
Sora?

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:36.760
Sora!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.030
Charlotte... Julie?

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:44.750
We're working as Miss Layla's
personal assistants now.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.440
Sora, you, like, haven't changed at all.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:55.380
This is Sora Naegino from Kaleido Stage.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.660
This is the producer, Mike Abbott.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.230
Welcome.

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:02.260
I look forward to working
with you for the next week.

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.790
I look forward to working
under your supervision.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:09.100
And this is the writer and the director
of this show, Cathy Taymor.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:12.670
Nice to meet you.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.010
Nice to meet you too.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:16.740
Okay...

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:19.280
I guess I don't need to alter costumes.

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:21.940
Layla fired the previous performer, you see.

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:24.150
Fired?

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:27.420
She was a professional performer
with a decent career,

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.890
but it seems Layla didn't like her.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:34.560
In the middle of the season, without
consulting the producer or the director!

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.630
Is that the kind of thing people normally do?

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:37.870
Well...

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.160
No! Normally they don't!

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:43.660
I just don't want to appear on stage with
someone who doesn't have any zeal.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.300
This is why I don't like spoiled rich girls.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:50.370
Her schedule happened to be open,
so we're okay,

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:53.380
but what were you going to do
if we couldn't find a replacement?

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:54.520
Oh... well... er...

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.250
Thank you for coming, Sora.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.390
Oh, you're welcome.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:02.880
But I can't be away from Kaleido Stage
for more than a week.

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.790
That's enough.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:08.020
We'll figure the rest out, so don't worry.

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:10.020
Right.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.970
You're only going to appear in one scene,

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:14.630
but it's a very important scene.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:20.230
That scene is Salome's dance, which will be
in the latter half of the show.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.530
Yes.

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:28.880
Anger and sorrow.

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:30.880
Love and hate.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:35.090
All of Salome's passion
is poured into that scene.

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:38.490
I want you to fire up the scene with an acrobatic
performance as a shadow of my character,

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:41.720
and raise the temperature of the stage.

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.270
Raise the temperature of the stage?

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.770
Once we've set up the rough outline
of how it will go,

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.300
how you want to perform is all up to you.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.210
In other words, do it ad lib.

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:52.370
Ad lib?!

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:55.410
Let's run through the basic outline.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.210
Yes.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:58.810
Please wait!

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:00.140
That voice is...

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.080
May!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:06.650
Who are you?

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.120
I'm May Wong.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:15.080
I was inspired by you, and joined Kaleido Stage
this year with the top score for new entrants.

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:16.990
May, why?

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:21.800
Please accept this.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.070
Thank you.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:28.680
So you're the newcomer who's playing the
leading role in the new production.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:31.700
Yes. I'm more talented than Sora.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:35.450
Instead of Sora, please let me be in the show!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:36.420
What?!

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.320
Rolling Flower!

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:51.530
May found out that I was invited by Miss Layla
and came to New York planning to do this?

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:59.100
Shining Flower!

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.100
Miracle Great!

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.880
Stop, May! Stop it!

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:08.880
What!

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.050
I'm the one who was invited by Miss Layla!

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.580
Get off this stage right now!

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:17.420
Miss Layla invited you because she
didn't know about me.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:26.600
It's like "A super powerful newcomer appears."

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.900
Sora, like, doesn't seem like she can win.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.440
This is interesting.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:32.370
Why don't we put them both on, Layla?

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.880
Those were my thoughts exactly.

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:41.980
Then, let's start rehearsal.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:45.480
Yeah. I want to put in an emergency
order for another costume.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:27.090
What do you think?

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.930
I think maybe I want one more idea
in there to make it fly,

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:31.520
well, let's put that in tomorrow.

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:36.470
Then, I'll take you to the hotel.

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:38.440
I booked a room at the Century Hotel,
which is close to here.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:41.340
Please don't tell me that you're going
to put me in the same room with Sora!

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:43.210
Uh... Yeah...

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.410
I REFUSE!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.180
May, don't be so selfish!

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:49.080
I'd rather sleep outside
than stay in a room with you!

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.250
Me too! Who wants to be with
someone like you?!

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:56.660
Quit your whining!

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:58.960
Save that energy for tomorrow's show!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:00.950
Uh... yes, ma'am.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:06.860
Say, if the two of you don't mind, why not cancel
your hotel reservation and come to my place?

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.120
Here we are.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.220
Wow...

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.150
Amazing...

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:27.890
That's New York for you.

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:29.460
Beautiful.

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:32.450
I'll try to make coffee now.
So make yourselves at home.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.090
"Try to make"?

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:36.730
Miss Layla,

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.930
that's where you put the water.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:41.000
And the coffee beans should be ground first.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.870
Really? Sorry.

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.600
You seldom drink coffee...

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:47.840
Having you really helps me out.

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:52.670
Oh, I'm honored to be of use to you, Miss!

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:58.950
Miss Layla's already started her new life here.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:04.360
I guess the legendary great maneuver
is already part of her past.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:05.860
This is interesting.

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.850
Why don't we out them both on, Layla?

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:11.590
Those were my thoughts exactly.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:15.470
I'm not the only one she has hopes for.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:18.240
Would you quit moping already?

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:19.640
Moping?

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:21.580
Now that we know both of us will be in the show,

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.040
if you don't pull yourself together,

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:24.880
Miss Layla will be the one who's embarrassed.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:29.850
I had so many things I wanted to talk with Miss
Layla about. I haven't seen her for so long.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:30.890
But, because of you...

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.050
Miss Layla isn't yours.

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:36.660
I also want to talk with Miss Layla.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:39.650
It was my dream to appear on the stage with her.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:47.640
I came here to have Miss Layla
recognize me as better than you.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.770
You're the one who injured Miss Layla...

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:51.640
You alone I WON'T lose to!

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.640
Wait a second.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:57.180
Did you say that Sora injured me?

00:12:57.180 --> 00:13:00.580
Because, if you hadn't paired with Sora
to perform the legendary great maneuver,

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.980
I'm sure you never would have been injured!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.420
Why don't you two have a seat?

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:13.730
I hurt myself because my mind
wasn't fully where it needed to be.

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.300
I still ventured to do the
legendary great maneuver

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:18.230
even if it meant smashing my shoulder.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.330
I did it of my own will.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:21.930
So it's wrong to put the blame on Sora for that.

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:27.410
I can no longer do that kind of performance,

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:31.910
but thanks to my injuries,
I think I have new opportunities.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:35.280
But, if you hadn't injured your shoulder,

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.650
right now you would be in an
even larger-scale show...

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:40.110
I chose that show.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:45.390
After I performed the legendary great maneuver,

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:49.100
when people heard that I would not
go back to Kaleido Stage anymore,

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:54.000
I got at lot of job offers to be in
movies, plays, and TV shows.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.670
But, after having accomplished
the legendary great maneuver,

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:00.540
none of them appealed to me.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.170
And then...

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:04.740
You have a guest.

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:07.320
Okay, now...

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:09.380
Here you go. A script.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:11.250
So how's the injury? When will it be healed?

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.690
To recover to the point where
I can live a normal life,

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:15.990
it will take about a month, maybe.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:19.760
It'd be great if you could recover faster than that,

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:21.360
but I guess there's nothing you can do.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:23.000
Why don't we do this together?

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:23.990
You won't regret it.

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:28.240
"Salome in Vegas"...

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:32.100
Everything about it was fresh.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:37.810
There were some people who murmured
that I'd come down in the world

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.280
because I appeared Off Broadway in a show
that wasn't even all that big.

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:43.720
But that didn't bother me at all.

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:47.450
Because there was something there
that motivated me again.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:52.220
I thought, "This is my new stage."

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:57.760
And Cathy is my new partner.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.830
Your new partner...

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.270
That's right.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.360
Miss Layla, I will do my best.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:07.710
So that I'll also be considered your partner.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:11.410
It was my dream to be able to appear on
the same stage with you, Miss Layla.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.480
What is your dream after that?

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:15.920
What?

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:17.820
After that?

00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:20.820
After all, your current dream
will come true tomorrow.

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:23.820
Oh... well... er...

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:27.190
I beat Sora and... No...

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:34.390
So, Miss Layla's current dream is here, huh?

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:36.700
Sora...

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.870
That's right.

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:43.430
I went and brewed coffee for both of you,
and you didn't...

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:47.070
It's bitter.

00:15:56.020 --> 00:16:00.360
And Cathy is my new partner.

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:06.570
I'm no longer Miss Layla's partner. I know that.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:10.030
We're walking down different paths,
so that's natural.

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:12.770
I know that, but...

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:16.940
I never expected to hear it so clearly,
straight out of Miss Layla's mouth like that.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:21.640
I never expected to feel so lonely
just hearing one word from Miss Layla.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:28.590
In the end, I can't stand on my own at all.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.220
It's pathetic...

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.030
This is not good.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:34.800
I won't be able to perform tomorrow
the way I feel now.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:35.890
I have to pull myself together.

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:52.150
Layla's constellation, Leo,
which emits a blindingly bright light.

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.420
And standing motionless in its shadow,
Sora's Sagittarius,

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:58.220
who's lost sight of the target
it should be aiming its arrows at.

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:07.960
Anyway, don't worry about anything.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:10.800
Just perform the way you feel like doing.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:11.770
Yes.

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:17.800
Stop looking at me with puppy eyes.

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:24.240
Get on the stage with enough spirit
to steal the part of Salome from me.

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:33.680
Salome, please dance for me.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:37.190
I don't want to dance right now, Herron.

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:43.990
My heart might be the only thing in this country
that doesn't always do as you please.

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:46.490
Salome...

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:51.500
Johann, your skin is as white as the
snow just fell on the ground.

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:54.910
And your lips are...

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:59.480
Salome, don't touch me!

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:01.440
Johann!

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:04.520
Johann...

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:08.480
I love you.

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:15.920
Get on the stage with enough spirit
to steal the part of Salome from me.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:17.790
Stand by!

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:22.590
Herron, I will dance for you.

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:26.710
In return, I want you to grant my wish.

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:40.020
Now the match begins, you two.

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:49.820
Attract the audience's eyes. Upstage me.

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:56.170
In order to meet Miss Layla's expectations...

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:59.500
I have to do a performance
which exceeds Miss Layla's.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:00.970
Miss Layla!

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:02.880
I want to be acknowledged.

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.110
I will not beaten by May.

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:05.240
I will not beaten by Sora.

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:06.840
I'm going to win no matter what!

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:08.350
I will make sure I win.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.090
Looking good.

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:28.700
But...

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:33.570
I cannot beat Miss Layla.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:48.620
Ask me for anything you want, Salome.

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:52.120
There's only one thing I want.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:55.790
So, this is all right with you?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:58.530
Yes.

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:09.030
Miss Layla's shining supremely
on this stage too.

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:11.340
But still...

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:14.410
I can't catch up with her at all.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:23.860
We couldn't match Miss Layla.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.480
I know.

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:33.830
Thank you very much for this week.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.600
Thanks to you, I was able to create
a satisfying show.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:37.590
Really?

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.070
Really.

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:40.910
Thanks to you,

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:44.810
Cathy understood what I meant when I said
we didn't have enough temperature on stage.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.920
Then that's why you invited me here?

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:49.950
Yes.

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:52.980
I thought I could show her what a heated stage
was really like if I was with you.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:55.390
But, Sora...

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:57.990
Back when I was still at Kaleido Stage,

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:01.550
I was afraid that you would
overtake me from behind.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:06.000
But I wasn't able to feel
that edge from you this time.

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:11.770
When you're having a hard time, you're
the only person who can save yourself.

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:15.180
What you're aiming at, what you want to grasp,

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:17.850
the only person who knows those things is you.

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:21.110
All the answers are inside you.

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:26.450
My current dream is on this stage.

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:31.360
But, the dream I told you about on
that day is also my important dream.

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:36.620
Please be my dream, Sora.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:41.360
I know you can become a true Kaleido Star.

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:43.260
Miss Layla...

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:46.840
Keep going after your dream without being lost.

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:50.280
If you do that, I'm sure the road to being
a real Kaleido Star will open for you.

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:53.150
Going after my dream...

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:54.140
That's right.

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:56.120
I'm counting on you.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:57.380
Yes.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:21:59.520
Please say hello to everyone at Kaleido Stage.

00:21:59.520 --> 00:21:59.790
Yes.

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:00.350
YES!

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:00.350
Yes.

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:02.150
Don't worry. I'll take care of it for you!

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:11.790
I still can see Fool?

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:15.340
I'll admit that I misunderstood you
about Miss Layla.

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:19.670
But it doesn't mean I'm giving up
competing with you.

00:22:19.670 --> 00:22:22.110
Yeah, I know.

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:25.580
I wonder what I want to do now.

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:28.780
The answer is inside of me...

